      "about": "Reading words must use only spelling patterns the child has been taught. Each pattern stage includes the ones before it. A word with a pattern above its level is left out of that level's pool (reading, listening and spelling cards alike). Grade 1 spelling step 4 and up includes two-syllable picture words, so it is not limited.",
