        "digraphs": "Two letters, one sound (sh ch th wh ck ng ll ss ff zz qu) and blends (frog, drum, fish)",
        "magicE": "Silent e makes the vowel say its name (cake, kite, bone)",
        "teams": "Vowel teams, r-controlled vowels, y as a vowel and welded sounds (rain, tree, star, fly, ball)",
        "any": "Irregular spellings (two, bear, lion)"
